      "aiSummary": "A reviewer mounted a Kiwibit Bird Feeder 2 Pro and received AI-driven alerts identifying species such as 'Great Tit' and 'Eurasian Blue Tit.' The feeder cost was reported as $350 reduced to $269 and attracted dozens of small colorful birds within weeks."
